title: "Source data and analysis code for: Asymmetric neural entrainment at resonance frequencies underlies unilateral spatial neglect"
abstract: >-
  Processed source data underlying Table 1 and main Figures 2–9, together with
  the transfer entropy analysis code and coupled-oscillator model code for the
  study of asymmetric neural entrainment in unilateral spatial neglect.
